                    implemented the RTF version 1.0 specification. All subsequent releases of Microsoft Word for Macintosh, 
                    as well as all Windows versions, can read and write in RTF format.

                    Microsoft maintains RTF. The final version was 1.9.1 in 2008, which implemented features of Office 2007. 
